      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated doctors and clinical technicians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents praise Dr. Pinney and the nursing technicians for their exceptional dedication, thoroughness, and warm manner. Reviewers frequently mention staff members by name, emphasizing how attentive and reassuring clinicians remain during stressful appointments. Clients note that personnel go the extra mile to research medications and communicate clearly."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling of nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviews consistently highlight the clinic's gentle and comforting approach toward pets, including timid rescues, senior dogs, and sick cats. Patrons report that staff members take time to make animals feel secure before beginning examinations or administering treatments, enabling even anxious dogs to enter the practice calmly and without fear."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Transparent and affordable care options"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Feedback regarding clinic fees is overwhelmingly favourable. Reviewers appreciate that veterinary staff consult owners about prices prior to performing diagnostics or procedures, ensuring complete financial transparency. Clients frequently describe treatment costs as highly competitive and accessible compared to other animal practices in the city."
      }
    }
  ],
